text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md\",\"oldString\":\"- `FULL_INVENTORY` fires only on an explicit \\\"show the whole toolkit\\\" request.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. MACHINE ROUTER\",\"newString\":\"- `FULL_INVENTORY` fires only on an explicit \\\"show the whole toolkit\\\" request.\\n- A mode whose `mode-registry.json` row names a `command` has two whole entries: read that command's document in full and follow it under the policy the advisor names, or follow this mode's packet. Pick one and keep to it. A mode whose row has `command: null` has only its packet.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. MACHINE ROUTER\"}"},"time":{"start":1794531688742,"end":1794531690223}}}}
